Subject: [PATCH] ATLViewDump: View tree dump in uiautomator form
 (ATL_VIEWDUMP)

Debugging aid for atl-doctor: compares the View tree under ATL with
uiautomator dump on Android. With ATL_VIEWDUMP=<dir> set, the main thread
answers requests in <dir>/request with <dir>/<name>.xml.

